{
    "version": "0.1.145",
    "description": "An open-source, out-of-the-box AI agent. Cross-device sessions stay on the original machine.",
    "homepage": "https://cindy.app",
    "license": "Apache-2.0",
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/releases/download/v0.1.145/cindy-0.1.145-win32-x64-cn.exe#/dl.7z",
            "hash": "c5263ee36a9d8a34374a95ab92d1e52ac854cd80f5bfc87dd730bb2ee239f1e6",
            "pre_install": [
                "Expand-7zipArchive \"$dir\\`$PLUGINSDIR\\app-64.7z\" \"$dir\"",
                "Remove-Item \"$dir\\`$*\", \"$dir\\*.nsi\" -Recurse -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue"
            ]
        }
    },
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "Cindy.exe",
            "Cindy CN"
        ]
    ],
    "notes": [
        "这是 Cindy 中国区（cn）构建，默认连接官方中国区云服务。国际区账号请安装 cindy。",
        "不要与 cindy（国际版）同时安装，以免快捷方式和数据目录冲突。",
        "跨设备续接、记忆和 Skills 同步依赖官方账号；选择 Skip Sign-In 时这些服务端能力不可用。",
        "请用 scoop update cindy-cn 更新。",
        "中国区版 Electron userData 是 %APPDATA%\\Cindy，其中 shared-system-skills 含应用自建的 .active 链接。便携化会把整个 userData 映射到 Scoop persist，.active 链接随同进入 persist；不要与 cindy 同时安装。"
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/makecindy/cindy"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/releases/download/v$version/cindy-$version-win32-x64-cn.exe#/dl.7z"
            }
        }
    },
    "portableProfile": {
        "mappings": [
            {
                "label": "roaming",
                "source": "AppData/Cindy",
                "target": "$persist_dir/roaming",
                "strategy": "symlink",
                "ensureTarget": true
            }
        ]
    }
}
